  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Conservation of Sea Turtle Populations through Community Participation in So.Tom Island, Democratic Republic of So Tom and Prncipe</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will conduct daily nighttime patrols on the main hawksbill nesting beaches of Sao Tome during the main nesting season, Sept. 15, 2017 - April 15, 2018; relocate nests as necessary to protect from poaching, predators and erosion; conduct education and awareness activities with local communities; conduct 6 workshops with national and local authorities on laws and conflict resolution with communities; and conduct a workshop with Tortoiseshell Carvers Association using alternative carving materials for handcrafts.</narrative>
  </description>
